WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:03.600
I'm definitely gonna be the first-star idol!

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.480
Nijino Yume's about to start her Aikatsu!

00:00:09.400 --> 00:00:11.490
So far on Aikatsu Stars!

00:00:11.490 --> 00:00:16.280
Venus Ark organized an idol event, Venus Wave.

00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:22.160
It's a super exciting event pitting idols against each other in a battle of fashion sense and stage ability.

00:00:22.790 --> 00:00:28.840
Rola surprised everyone when she got her own Star Premium Rare Coord after her performance.

00:00:29.500 --> 00:00:33.380
Now it's my and Kirara-chan's turns to show what we can do.

00:00:37.760 --> 00:00:40.430
Amazing... you're amazing, Rola!

00:00:40.430 --> 00:00:43.730
That was the most incredible performance you've ever had!

00:00:44.440 --> 00:00:49.230
She gained her Star Premium Rare Coord at such a grand event.

00:00:49.230 --> 00:00:53.360
Her Aikatsu Ranking is sure to get a huge boost.

00:00:55.360 --> 00:00:58.570
The Mars Star Premium Rare Coord. {they changed this line from last episode}

00:00:58.570 --> 00:01:00.620
That makes five.

00:02:37.550 --> 00:02:43.640
The idols each compete through their fashion sense 
by demonstrating their brand's charms to the fullest.

00:02:43.640 --> 00:02:50.020
Then there's the stage performance. 
Both aspects are absolutely necessary to an idol.

00:02:50.020 --> 00:02:53.270
Only Elza-sama could've possibly created such an event.

00:02:53.270 --> 00:02:57.860
Yes. And as a result, Rola was able to realize her potential.

00:02:57.860 --> 00:03:00.490
Koharu, I believe you had a hand in that?

00:03:01.030 --> 00:03:03.910
Yeah, but really only a bit.

00:03:04.660 --> 00:03:07.580
Rola earned it with her own hard work.

00:03:09.710 --> 00:03:13.330
<i>Wonderful. I'm so happy for you, Rola.</i>

00:03:14.000 --> 00:03:17.090
The Aikatsu System acknowledged her.

00:03:17.090 --> 00:03:22.640
She's infused her own style into Spice Chord after inheriting it from Tsubasa Kisaragi.

00:03:22.640 --> 00:03:24.300
May I ask something?

00:03:24.800 --> 00:03:30.060
Was the entire purpose of this event to draw out more Star Premium Rare Coords?

00:03:30.060 --> 00:03:35.820
That would explain why you overlooked Lily 
and Mahiru, who both already possess theirs.

00:03:35.820 --> 00:03:41.150
I simply wish that idols constantly aim for greater heights.

00:03:41.150 --> 00:03:42.780
That's all.

00:03:45.320 --> 00:03:46.370
Yume!

00:03:47.290 --> 00:03:49.120
You were great, Rola!

00:03:49.120 --> 00:03:50.370
Thanks!

00:03:50.370 --> 00:03:51.580
Here we go! {but they never "se-no"}{maybe they do it in secret}

00:03:51.580 --> 00:03:53.790
Aikatsu!

00:03:54.880 --> 00:03:58.050
Kirara's gonna blow you away with her show too!

00:03:58.050 --> 00:03:59.550
Well so am I!

00:03:59.550 --> 00:04:01.420
She hasn't lost!

00:04:01.420 --> 00:04:03.380
Yume-chan is number one!

00:04:03.380 --> 00:04:07.010
Hmph! Were your eyes even open when Rola-chan was up there?

00:04:07.010 --> 00:04:09.270
She was so cool my head exploded!

00:04:09.270 --> 00:04:10.520
That explains it.

00:04:10.520 --> 00:04:13.770
Now I know why you can't see how much more amazing Yume-chan is.

00:04:13.770 --> 00:04:15.310
Right, Saya? {sounds like Saaya as a nickname but CCs just have Saya}{it could just be saya}

00:04:15.310 --> 00:04:17.400
Huh? Um...

00:04:17.400 --> 00:04:21.320
Let her know, Saya. Tell her how great Yume-chan is.

00:04:21.320 --> 00:04:24.320
Um, Sumomo-chan, I...

00:04:24.910 --> 00:04:28.080
Natsuna! Sumomo! Don't misunderstand!

00:04:28.080 --> 00:04:29.160
Stella!

00:04:29.160 --> 00:04:31.750
Argue all you want, but Kirara-chan's the best!

00:04:31.750 --> 00:04:34.750
Have you never gazed upon FuwaFuwa Dream?

00:04:34.750 --> 00:04:35.580
Huh?!

00:04:35.580 --> 00:04:39.960
'Cause if you did, there's no way you wouldn't be Kirara-chan's fan!

00:04:39.960 --> 00:04:41.420
You wanna say that again?

00:04:41.420 --> 00:04:43.010
You make no sense!

00:04:43.930 --> 00:04:47.390
Why can't everyone just get along?

00:04:49.760 --> 00:04:51.350
I can't stand this!

00:04:52.390 --> 00:04:56.900
<i>Rola was fantastic, so I've gotta make sure to match her.</i>

00:04:59.070 --> 00:05:01.440
Huh? Where is this?

00:05:01.440 --> 00:05:04.320
Did you get lost looking for something?

00:05:04.320 --> 00:05:06.610
Yume-chan!

00:05:06.610 --> 00:05:08.990
H-Handshake please!

00:05:08.990 --> 00:05:10.700
Huh? Sure thing.

00:05:12.410 --> 00:05:15.580
It's like I'm holding hands with a goddess! {was gonna go with God capital, but yeah}{there are many things that can possible here but sure}

00:05:15.580 --> 00:05:17.670
I think that's a bit too much.

00:05:18.500 --> 00:05:20.880
But what brought you here?

00:05:23.010 --> 00:05:27.180
Everyone kept on fighting, and I couldn't take it.

00:05:27.180 --> 00:05:30.140
I just ran away without thinking.

00:05:30.560 --> 00:05:32.010
What?!

00:05:32.010 --> 00:05:34.430
Our fans are arguing?

00:05:34.430 --> 00:05:38.480
That's right. They were all shouting at each other.

00:05:38.480 --> 00:05:41.270
I don't like things like that...

00:05:41.820 --> 00:05:43.280
What started it?

00:05:43.280 --> 00:05:45.490
It's about who's the best...

00:05:46.030 --> 00:05:51.450
Um, do you and Rola-chan argue about who's number one too?

00:05:51.450 --> 00:05:53.490
Sometimes we do.

00:05:53.490 --> 00:05:58.960
But the thing is, me and Rola are 
true rivals, so we're close friends too.

00:05:58.960 --> 00:06:01.210
What's a true rival?

00:06:02.210 --> 00:06:04.170
How to put it...

00:06:04.800 --> 00:06:08.380
I always cheer for Rola to do her best,

00:06:08.380 --> 00:06:13.010
and so when she does, you get an amazing performance like she had today.

00:06:13.010 --> 00:06:14.100
Okay.

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:17.600
And then that makes me want to do my best too!

00:06:18.140 --> 00:06:21.190
I'm sure Rola thinks the same way too.

00:06:23.980 --> 00:06:25.530
I'm coming in.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:27.610
Yume?

00:06:29.280 --> 00:06:32.450
Oh, excuse me. Is Yume in?

00:06:32.450 --> 00:06:39.000
Not at the moment. She's backstage 
stretching and doing vocal exercises.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:41.750
I see. I'm sorry for interrupting.

00:06:41.750 --> 00:06:46.260
Hold it. I wanted to say that you had a brilliant performance.

00:06:46.260 --> 00:06:48.130
Thank you!

00:06:48.130 --> 00:06:51.760
Seeing it got Yume rather fired up.

00:06:52.090 --> 00:06:56.020
I know that Yume will impress you just as much!

00:06:57.810 --> 00:07:03.310
Aikatsu isn't all fun and games—
once in a while there are sad times too.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:08.990
But when that happens, our fans are there to cheer us up. {I've been deliberately writing simpler for this whole conversation}

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:10.860
Really?

00:07:10.860 --> 00:07:13.740
I'm the same as you, Saya-chan.

00:07:13.740 --> 00:07:16.490
I want everyone to get along and cheer for each other.{we could probably have used "support" for this whole thing but that's also}{also what I used for the title}

00:07:16.490 --> 00:07:23.000
We need to be like you and Rola-chan and cheer everyone on together.

00:07:23.000 --> 00:07:25.630
I'll try talking to them again.

00:07:26.920 --> 00:07:28.050
Hold on a sec!

00:07:29.670 --> 00:07:32.390
I just got a great idea.

00:07:32.390 --> 00:07:34.680
Hey, would you let me handle it?

00:07:35.930 --> 00:07:36.760
Sure!

00:07:47.980 --> 00:07:49.240
<i>Okay!</i>

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:51.900
<i>Now that I've got it, I need to prepare!</i>

00:07:51.900 --> 00:07:53.950
<i>There's hardly any time left!</i>

00:07:54.820 --> 00:07:55.870
I'm back!

00:07:56.240 --> 00:07:58.790
Where were you? Very soon—

00:07:57.830 --> 00:07:58.790
Kasagami-san!

00:07:58.790 --> 00:08:01.500
There's something I'd like to discuss!

00:08:01.500 --> 00:08:04.500
Wh-What are you thinking behind those shining eyes?

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:05.920
It must be something awful!

00:08:05.920 --> 00:08:08.880
Please, I need your help!

00:08:08.880 --> 00:08:10.590
What? What do you want?!

00:08:10.590 --> 00:08:12.260
No!

00:08:12.260 --> 00:08:13.970
Pardon me.

00:08:13.970 --> 00:08:17.140
Yume, are you back? I was looking for you.

00:08:17.140 --> 00:08:20.140
Rola! Perfect timing.

00:08:21.560 --> 00:08:25.150
Peoples! Kirara's up next!

00:08:25.150 --> 00:08:27.900
If you don't give all your attention to Kirara...

00:08:27.900 --> 00:08:29.530
Baa!

00:08:29.530 --> 00:08:31.530
Baa!

00:08:31.860 --> 00:08:35.450
Kirara's white tee coord is fluffy and puffy!

00:08:35.450 --> 00:08:38.370
Aren't these heart patterns just the cutest? {wappen, apparantly from german}{ach so}

00:08:38.370 --> 00:08:40.290
It's so cute!

00:08:40.290 --> 00:08:44.540
No, Yume-chan's coord is gonna be way more awesome!

00:08:44.540 --> 00:08:46.630
Hmph! Did you forget again?

00:08:46.630 --> 00:08:49.590
Rola-chan's was the coolest ever!

00:08:49.590 --> 00:08:51.260
Come on...

00:08:51.710 --> 00:08:54.220
I just got a great idea.

00:08:54.220 --> 00:08:56.720
Hey, would you let me handle it?

00:08:56.720 --> 00:09:00.970
That's right, Yume-chan will definitely pull through.

00:09:00.970 --> 00:09:04.980
Okay, y'all ready for Kirara's stage? Kiraran!

00:09:08.230 --> 00:09:09.860
<i>I'm not gonna lose!</i>

00:09:11.230 --> 00:09:14.610
Come have a fluffy sweet dream with Kirara!

00:09:36.680 --> 00:09:39.390
I'll knock 'em out with my battle dress!

00:12:36.560 --> 00:12:38.940
I knew Kirara-chan was the best!

00:12:38.940 --> 00:12:41.320
She's gonna win for sure!

00:12:41.320 --> 00:12:42.740
That's nonsense!

00:12:42.740 --> 00:12:44.610
Don't get ahead of yourself!

00:12:46.870 --> 00:12:51.790
Hey, stop it already! Yume-chan's about to come on stage.

00:12:51.790 --> 00:12:53.210
Everyone!

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:56.250
Are you having fun?

00:12:56.880 --> 00:12:58.340
Yume-chan!

00:12:58.960 --> 00:13:00.800
Yume-chan!

00:13:01.090 --> 00:13:04.930
I made my coord out of a bunch of different things!

00:13:05.550 --> 00:13:07.930
I took the coolness of Rola's Spice Chord,

00:13:08.260 --> 00:13:11.430
mixed it with the cuteness of 
Kirara-chan's FuwaFuwa Dream,

00:13:11.430 --> 00:13:13.890
and topped it all off with Berry Parfait!

00:13:14.770 --> 00:13:16.600
What do you all think?

00:13:17.350 --> 00:13:19.310
Thank goodness we made it.

00:13:19.310 --> 00:13:22.360
I can't believe that girl changed it at the last minute.

00:13:23.570 --> 00:13:26.530
Koharu-chan gave me the push I needed.

00:13:27.200 --> 00:13:32.490
The most important thing to me is 
to let everyone shine their brightest.

00:13:32.950 --> 00:13:36.250
That's Berry Parfait! That's why...

00:13:37.420 --> 00:13:39.040
Honestly...

00:13:40.460 --> 00:13:42.250
Yay!

00:13:42.800 --> 00:13:44.720
So cute!

00:13:44.720 --> 00:13:47.890
<i>That was Yume-chan's bright idea! {nice}{I wish she had a bigger vocabulary}{you misunderstood, I was complimenting myself, or rather how it's similar in both languages}</i>

00:13:48.840 --> 00:13:50.890
Yume-chan is great!

00:13:50.890 --> 00:13:52.390
Didn't I tell you?

00:13:52.390 --> 00:13:52.930
Hmph!

00:13:52.930 --> 00:13:54.310
Come on!

00:13:54.310 --> 00:13:56.560
It's really no good...

00:13:56.560 --> 00:14:00.310
Everyone! Thanks for all your support!

00:14:00.310 --> 00:14:07.070
Today, I'd like to express my gratitude for everyone who cheers me on.

00:14:07.070 --> 00:14:08.360
Gratitude?

00:14:09.740 --> 00:14:12.450
Now I'll cheer for you!

00:14:12.450 --> 00:14:17.000
Hooray! Hooray! Everyone! {brace yourself. also there might be other ways of doing this part, but with all the repetition it would stand out}{I like repetition, it means fewer lines to edit}

00:14:17.000 --> 00:14:20.750
Hooray! Hooray! Everyone! Hooray! Hooray! Everyone!

00:14:21.920 --> 00:14:25.630
Hooray! Hooray! Rola!

00:14:25.630 --> 00:14:28.760
Hooray! Hooray! Yume!

00:14:29.340 --> 00:14:34.640
<i>Yume-chan is cheering for Rola-chan, 
and Rola-chan is cheering for Yume-chan...</i>

00:14:34.640 --> 00:14:35.890
That's it!

00:14:35.890 --> 00:14:40.020
Hooray! Hooray! Natsuna!

00:14:40.020 --> 00:14:41.650
Huh? Saya?

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:46.190
Hooray! Hooray! Natsuna!

00:14:46.190 --> 00:14:49.910
Hooray! Hooray! Natsuna! Hooray! Hooray! Natsuna!

00:14:50.240 --> 00:14:53.410
Yume-chan is cheering for me?

00:14:53.410 --> 00:14:57.040
Hooray! Hooray! Stella!

00:14:57.040 --> 00:14:59.160
Hooray! Hooray! Stella!

00:14:59.460 --> 00:15:03.170
Rola-chan is calling my name!

00:15:03.170 --> 00:15:07.130
Hooray! Hooray! Sumomo!

00:15:07.130 --> 00:15:09.380
What's going on? That looks like fun!

00:15:09.380 --> 00:15:11.050
Let Kirara in!

00:15:12.850 --> 00:15:16.430
Hooray! Hooray! Sumomo! Hooray! Hooray! Sumomo!

00:15:19.770 --> 00:15:24.270
Hooray! Hooray! Yume-chan!

00:15:24.270 --> 00:15:28.070
Hooray! Hooray! Rola-chan!

00:15:28.070 --> 00:15:32.240
Hooray! Hooray! Kirara-chan!

00:15:32.240 --> 00:15:35.870
Hooray! Hooray! Yume-chan!

00:15:35.870 --> 00:15:39.750
Hooray! Hooray! Rola-chan!

00:15:39.750 --> 00:15:43.250
Hooray! Hooray! Kirara-chan!

00:15:43.630 --> 00:15:47.130
Hooray! Hooray! Saya-chan!

00:15:47.130 --> 00:15:49.590
Thank you, Yume-chan!

00:15:50.260 --> 00:15:53.390
Okay, now it's time for my performance!

00:15:58.770 --> 00:16:00.730
I'll take everyone's feelings to heart.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.020
Nijino Yume, ready to go!

00:19:18.340 --> 00:19:20.760
Now then, the results are in.

00:19:21.550 --> 00:19:23.100
In third:

00:19:25.970 --> 00:19:27.310
Nijino Yume!

00:19:29.560 --> 00:19:31.480
Next, in second:

00:19:35.150 --> 00:19:36.650
Hanazono Kirara!

00:19:38.320 --> 00:19:40.740
And gloriously taking first:

00:19:44.070 --> 00:19:45.620
Sakuraba Rola!

00:19:49.870 --> 00:19:56.880
Some people expected it to come down to Yume-chan and Kirara-chan, but Rola ended up on top.{I thought yume and laura were heavy underdogs on the paris betting market}{hence the "some"}

00:19:56.880 --> 00:20:00.510
Yes, but they all had marvelous dresses.

00:20:00.510 --> 00:20:03.470
And amongst them all, FuwaFuwa Dream was the best.

00:20:03.470 --> 00:20:07.890
Honestly, what are you doing, Hanazono Kirara? {the best scene in the entire episode}

00:20:08.770 --> 00:20:11.020
<i>I'm so glad for you, Rola.</i>

00:20:19.030 --> 00:20:24.700
To conclude Venus Wave, our organizer 
Elza Forte will deliver her closing remarks.{should we have been using "sponsor" instead of "organize/organizer"?}{well, it's also held on venus ark itself}

00:20:28.490 --> 00:20:37.540
The results have been decided, but every single idol who participated is certain to continue improving her Aikatsu.

00:20:37.540 --> 00:20:42.420
Audience, please look forward to their future activities.

00:20:50.390 --> 00:20:52.890
Rola, congrats on winning!

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:56.480
And also, thanks for helping me out with the cheering.

00:20:56.480 --> 00:21:00.360
I was happy to. It's just like you always to put the fans first.

00:21:00.360 --> 00:21:03.030
Yep! I'm just glad it went over well.

00:21:03.030 --> 00:21:04.320
I'm not glad!

00:21:05.070 --> 00:21:07.870
Kirara's mad she lost!

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:10.490
Next time I'm definitely gonna win!

00:21:10.490 --> 00:21:11.370
Kirara.

00:21:11.750 --> 00:21:13.710
Settle down.

00:21:15.460 --> 00:21:17.830
Elza-sama scolded me!

00:21:17.830 --> 00:21:20.500
Kirara did something baaad!

00:21:23.800 --> 00:21:24.760
Rola!

00:21:25.180 --> 00:21:26.890
I'll lend a hand.

00:21:26.890 --> 00:21:29.260
Koharu! Thanks.

00:21:29.260 --> 00:21:32.390
I couldn't have won it without you.

00:21:32.390 --> 00:21:38.270
Don't say that. It was your own effort and determination that the Aikatsu System acknowledged.

00:21:38.900 --> 00:21:40.150
Koharu!

00:21:43.030 --> 00:21:44.950
Yume-chan!

00:21:45.530 --> 00:21:47.700
Everyone's friends again!

00:21:47.700 --> 00:21:49.740
Really? That's great.

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:52.790
Hang on... everyone!

00:21:53.120 --> 00:21:55.040
Yume-chan!

00:21:57.670 --> 00:21:59.170
Ready, and!

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:02.710
Hooray! Hooray! Yume-chan!

00:22:02.710 --> 00:22:06.220
Hooray! Hooray! Yume-chan! Hooray! Hooray! Yume-chan!

00:22:06.220 --> 00:22:09.760
Hooray! Hooray! Rola-chan! Hooray! Hooray! Rola-chan!

00:22:09.760 --> 00:22:13.310
Hooray! Hooray! Kirara-chan! Hooray! Hooray! Kirara-chan!

00:22:13.310 --> 00:22:16.770
Hooray! Hooray! Yume-chan! Hooray! Hooray! Yume-chan!

00:22:16.770 --> 00:22:20.230
Hooray! Hooray! Rola-chan! Hooray! Hooray! Rola-chan!

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:22.020
Hooray! Hooray! Kirara-chan!

00:22:22.020 --> 00:22:24.110
<i>Thanks, everyone!</i>

00:23:55.740 --> 00:23:57.990
I'm so mad I lost!

00:23:57.990 --> 00:23:59.700
Next time I'll win!

00:23:59.700 --> 00:24:02.870
Hooray! Hooray! Kirara!

00:24:02.870 --> 00:24:04.960
Cheering for yourself, I see.

00:24:04.960 --> 00:24:09.960
I'm going to make Berry Parfait a brand that lets everyone shine their brightest.

00:24:10.510 --> 00:24:13.590
Yuzu-senpai is holding a treasure hunt for her concert?

00:24:13.590 --> 00:24:15.180
No way! Seriously?

00:24:15.180 --> 00:24:17.260
Fun is the best!

00:24:17.260 --> 00:24:19.100
Next time on Aikatsu Stars!

00:24:19.100 --> 00:24:22.230
Summer! The pool! It's a treasure hunt!

00:24:22.230 --> 00:24:24.400
Become the first-star idol!
